Data "a point, so standing right in front of it fills both ears."
Data ""
Data "Your own movie: put it into the data folder next to the program, or give its path"
Data "on the command line. MP4, MKV, WebM, AVI, MPEG and more work (see OpenMovie)."
Data ""
Data "Mouse looks around, W A S D walk, Shift runs."
Data "P pauses the movie, R plays it from the start, Escape opens the pause menu."
Data ""
Data "Movie volume and looping are in the options."
